## Session End

1. If mid-task: update "Last Checkpoint" in the current task file
2. If task completed: move to `tasks/done/` (see Task File Management)
3. Stage changes and show `git diff --cached` for review before committing:

```bash
git add tasks/ docs/ platforms/ scripts/ servers/ modules/ \
        CLAUDE.md SYSTEM.example.md _memory_template.md \
        .claude/settings.json .cursor/rules/
git diff --cached            # review before committing
git commit -m "<message>"    # on the user's go-ahead
```

